          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi sasa, uniapie kwa BWANA, ya kwamba hutawakatilia mbali wazao wangu baada yangu, wala hutaliharibu jina langu katika ukoo wa baba yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.24.21",
