          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi akamwapia Sauli. Kisha Sauli akaenda zake kwao; lakini Daudi na watu wake wakapanda kwenda ngomeni.",
